<%# Not found: a person or member out of the writer's reach, or a meeting moved meanwhile (the
    lock reloaded it into its new project). The dialog instance goes and the reason comes as a
    flash; nothing of the meeting is drawn again, so a moved meeting shows nothing of the
    project it is in now. %>
<% if @modal_token %>
  <%= turbo_stream.remove participant_link_modal_instance_id(@meeting, @modal_token) %>
<% end %>
<%= turbo_stream.prepend 'flash', partial: 'layouts/flash', locals: { flash: { alert: @errors.to_sentence } } %>
